-- title:
--   Is MCS: singleton argument loc Consistent
-- statement:
--   If an application belongs to an MCS, each singleton theory generated by
--   one of its arguments is locally consistent.  Otherwise framing an argument's
--   derived bottom into the application and then propagating bottom contradicts
--   the MCS consistency.
--
--   Source: https://github.com/LeanPool/lean-pool/blob/e110decb9d02249d99fa85a144e6a659dea91440/LeanPool/MatchingLogic/EntryIII/CanonicalCore.lean#L149-L173
-- source:
--   https://github.com/LeanPool/lean-pool/blob/e110decb9d02249d99fa85a144e6a659dea91440/LeanPool/MatchingLogic/EntryIII/CanonicalCore.lean#L149-L173

module
